{"ticker":"DG","updated":"2026-11-06T23:09:39Z","profile":{"longName":"Dollar General Corporation","shortName":"Dollar General Corporation","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Discount Stores","country":"United States","website":"https://www.dollargeneral.com","fullTimeEmployees":194000,"marketCap":29507493888,"trailingPE":17.37013,"forwardPE":16.084904,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.6761881,"pegRatio":1.72,"targetMeanPrice":141.51724,"targetHighPrice":178.0,"targetLowPrice":90.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":29,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.052,"earningsGrowth":0.333,"grossMargins":0.31160998,"operatingMargins":0.06813,"profitMargins":0.03903,"totalRevenue":43637997568,"beta":0.191,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":158.23,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":95.11,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.71},"summary":"Dollar General Corporation, a discount retailer, provides various merchandise products in the southern, southwestern, midwestern, and eastern United States. It offers consumable products, including paper towels, bath tissues, paper dinnerware, trash and storage bags, disinfectants, and laundry products; packaged food, such as cereals, pasta, canned soups, canned meats, fruits and vegetables, condiments, spices, sugar, and flour; and perishables, including milk, eggs, bread, refrigerated and frozen food, beer, wine, and produce; candy, cookies, crackers, salty snacks, and carbonated beverages; over-the-counter medicines and personal care products including soap, body wash, shampoo, cosmetics, dental hygiene and foot care products; pet supplies and pet food; and tobacco products. The company also provides seasonal products comprising holiday items, toys, batteries, small electronics, greeting cards, stationery, prepaid phones and accessories, gardening supplies, hardware, automotive, and home office supplies; home products include kitchen supplies, cookware, small appliances, light bulbs, storage containers, frames, candles, craft supplies and kitchen, and bed and bath soft goods; and apparel products for infants, toddlers, girls, boys, women and men, as well as socks, underwear, disposable diapers, shoes and accessories. The company was formerly known as J.L. Turner & Son, Inc. ","summary_zh":"Dollar General Corporation 是一家折扣零售商，在美國南部、西南部、中西部和東部提供各種商品。它提供消耗品，包括紙巾、浴巾、紙質餐具、垃圾袋和儲物袋、消毒劑和洗衣產品；包裝食品，如穀物、麵食、罐頭湯、罐頭肉、水果和蔬菜、調味品、香料、糖和麵粉；和易腐爛食品，包括牛奶、雞蛋、麵包、冷藏和冷凍食品、啤酒、葡萄酒和農產品；糖果、餅乾、薄脆餅乾、鹹味零食和碳酸飲料；非處方藥品和個人護理產品，包括肥皂、沐浴露、洗髮精、化妝品、牙齒衛生和足部護理產品；寵物用品和寵物食品；和煙草製品。該公司還提供季節性產品，包括節日用品、玩具、電池、小型電子產品、賀卡、文具、預付費電話和配件、園藝用品、五金、汽車和家庭辦公用品；家居產品包括廚房用品、炊具、小家電、燈泡、儲物容器、框架、蠟燭、工藝用品和廚房、床和浴室紡織品；嬰兒、尿布、尿布、假衣該公司前身為 J.L. Turner & Son, Inc.。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"折扣店","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":110.57,"h":110.7,"l":107.26,"c":108.72,"v":3468100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":107.78,"h":108.3,"l":104.36,"c":104.55,"v":4369200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":104.5,"h":106.49,"l":104.03,"c":106.47,"v":3130700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":106.68,"h":107.13,"l":104.72,"c":105.39,"v":2931600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":104.44,"h":105.42,"l":103.72,"c":104.4,"v":2557300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":104.06,"h":104.96,"l":103.49,"c":104.52,"v":3383200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":104.31,"h":105.0,"l":103.34,"c":104.21,"v":2313400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":104.66,"h":106.24,"l":104.49,"c":106.14,"v":2592100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":106.07,"h":107.28,"l":104.97,"c":106.9,"v":3963600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":107.28,"h":107.34,"l":101.04,"c":102.11,"v":6059400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":102.1,"h":102.22,"l":99.9,"c":101.86,"v":3549400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":102.24,"h":104.4,"l":102.17,"c":103.67,"v":2840000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":103.17,"h":104.51,"l":103.04,"c":104.5,"v":2461100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":104.92,"h":105.93,"l":102.59,"c":102.85,"v":2467900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":103.21,"h":103.21,"l":101.67,"c":102.12,"v":3158400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":102.6,"h":103.0,"l":100.89,"c":102.94,"v":3380300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":103.11,"h":103.83,"l":101.22,"c":103.35,"v":4139100},{"t":"2025-10-01